<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - May 12.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - May 12.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Liverpool Jul 121.00</p>
<p>Southampton Jun 114.00 Jul 116.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat Devon Oct/Dec 101.00</p>
<p>East Anglia Oct/Dec 102.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Oxfordshire May 93.00 Jun 94.00</p>
<p>Avon four May 94.00 Jun 95.50</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire May 92.50 Jun 93.50</p>
